        {
          "id": "c4082b56-6770-4475-8604-8229b82b767a",
          "name": "Complete biometric authentication",
          "request": {
            "name": "Complete biometric authentication",
            "description": {
              "content": "Complete biometric authentication flow for MFA.\n\n## Login Flow\n1. Client must first call `/v2/biometric/challenge` to get a challenge and state\n2. Client prompts for biometric authentication (Face ID / Touch ID / Fingerprint)\n3. Client signs the challenge with the private key from secure storage\n4. Client sends the signature, credential_id, device_metadata, and state to this endpoint\n5. Server verifies the signature using the stored public key\n6. If valid, server issues access and refresh tokens\n\n## Signature Format\n- **Algorithm**: ECDSA with SHA-256\n- **Encoding**: DER-encoded ASN.1\n- **iOS**: Output of `SecKeyCreateSignature` with `.ecdsaSignatureMessageX962SHA256`\n- **Android**: Output of `Signature.getInstance(\"SHA256withECDSA\")`\n- **Purpose**: Authenticates the user by verifying ownership of the registered credential\n\n## State Requirement\n- The `state` from `/v2/biometric/challenge` is required\n- State must be valid and not expired\n- State can only be used once\n",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
            "url": {
              "path": [
                "v2",
                "biometric",
                "complete"
              ],
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "query": [],
              "variable": []
            },
            "header": [
              {
                "disabled": false,
                "description": "(Required) tenant-id of the client integrating with guardian",
                "key": "tenant-id",
                "value": "<string>"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "method": "POST",
            "auth": null,
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"refresh_token\": \"<string>\",\n  \"state\": \"<string>\",\n  \"client_id\": \"<string>\",\n  \"credential_id\": \"<string>\",\n  \"device_metadata\": {\n    \"device_id\": \"<string>\",\n    \"platform\": \"<string>\",\n    \"device_model\": \"<string>\",\n    \"os_version\": \"<string>\",\n    \"app_version\": \"<string>\",\n    \"device_name\": \"<string>\"\n  },\n  \"signature\": \"<string>\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
